WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.802
Have you heard

00:00:01.802 --> 00:00:03.303
Drink more water when you can

00:00:03.303 --> 00:00:04.972
drinking more water won't do any harm

00:00:04.972 --> 00:00:06.306
Wait a mininute

00:00:06.306 --> 00:00:08.509
Drinking too much water can cause problems

00:00:08.508 --> 00:00:09.409
Did you know

00:00:09.409 --> 00:00:11.011
A junior high school student

00:00:11.011 --> 00:00:11.879
He went to attend

00:00:11.879 --> 00:00:14.114
his parents' company's spring party

00:00:14.114 --> 00:00:16.516
There will be a water drinking competition on that day

00:00:16.517 --> 00:00:17.351
To win

00:00:17.351 --> 00:00:19.219
the 6000 prize

00:00:19.219 --> 00:00:19.820
Did you know

00:00:19.820 --> 00:00:24.157
He drank 60 glasses of water in 30 minutes.

00:00:24.157 --> 00:00:24.725
Probably

00:00:24.725 --> 00:00:27.160
6000cc of water

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:27.961
After returning home

00:00:27.961 --> 00:00:30.230
Dizziness, vomiting, convulsions

00:00:30.230 --> 00:00:31.865
The whole person is very uncomfortable

00:00:31.865 --> 00:00:35.269
Send him to the hospital immediately

00:00:35.269 --> 00:00:37.905
Wow, this is too scary.

00:00:39.273 --> 00:00:40.073
Hu Naiwen starts his lecture

00:00:40.073 --> 00:00:41.975
I am your old friend, Doctor Hu

00:00:41.975 --> 00:00:43.544
I want to share this episode with you

00:00:43.544 --> 00:00:49.049
1.Drinking more water is fine, but drinking the wrong amount can damage your kidneys and heart

00:00:49.049 --> 00:00:54.254
2.Swollen face and cold feet, it turns out that the water is stuck

00:00:54.254 --> 00:01:00.060
3.Drink life-saving water like this to prevent cardiovascular and cerebrovascular diseases

00:01:00.060 --> 00:01:05.098
4.Are you secretly lacking water? Get the clue from 1 place

00:01:05.098 --> 00:01:09.836
5.In these 3 situations, remember to drink more water

00:01:10.370 --> 00:01:12.306
Drink more water, it's okay

00:01:12.306 --> 00:01:15.175
Drinking the wrong amount may damage your kidneys and heart

00:01:15.175 --> 00:01:17.544
The last time we took the MRT

00:01:17.544 --> 00:01:19.313
See a young man

00:01:19.313 --> 00:01:21.782
He filled a kettle

00:01:21.782 --> 00:01:22.783
Very large

00:01:22.783 --> 00:01:24.918
Looks like 1500cc

00:01:24.918 --> 00:01:26.253
People are very particular now

00:01:26.253 --> 00:01:28.388
Have drunk enough water today?

00:01:28.388 --> 00:01:30.824
How many cc drink per day?

00:01:30.824 --> 00:01:32.192
I don't encourage you

00:01:32.192 --> 00:01:34.027
to drink too much water.

00:01:34.027 --> 00:01:36.163
The junior high school student I just mentioned

00:01:36.163 --> 00:01:37.965
Just drank more water

00:01:37.965 --> 00:01:40.100
almost lost life.

00:01:40.100 --> 00:01:41.268
fine

00:01:41.268 --> 00:01:43.837
Finally the hospital saved him.

00:01:43.837 --> 00:01:46.073
It saved his kidneys.

00:01:46.073 --> 00:01:48.575
Fortunately, everyone is OK.

00:01:48.575 --> 00:01:51.545
Don't drink too much

00:01:51.545 --> 00:01:52.946
We should drink normally.

00:01:52.946 --> 00:01:54.548
Nothing will happen

00:01:54.548 --> 00:01:57.551
The kidneys are like the body's floodgates

00:01:57.551 --> 00:01:59.720
Responsible for filtering blood every day

00:01:59.720 --> 00:02:02.089
Drain excess water

00:02:02.089 --> 00:02:03.690
and metabolic waste products

00:02:03.690 --> 00:02:06.793
Up to 18 liters of urine can be excreted per day

00:02:06.793 --> 00:02:08.595
This process is not just about detoxification

00:02:08.595 --> 00:02:10.564
Maintains body water

00:02:10.564 --> 00:02:12.766
Balance with electrolytes

00:02:12.766 --> 00:02:14.001
However,

00:02:14.001 --> 00:02:16.303
he kidneys have a limited drainage rate.

00:02:16.303 --> 00:02:18.271
If within a short period of time

00:02:18.271 --> 00:02:19.573
For example, within 3 hours

00:02:19.573 --> 00:02:22.142
Drink more than 2 liters of water

00:02:22.142 --> 00:02:25.779
The kidneys may not be able to process it in time

00:02:25.779 --> 00:02:27.080
Causes water retention

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:29.149
and electrolyte imbalance

00:02:29.149 --> 00:02:31.551
Further leading to acute water intoxication

00:02:31.551 --> 00:02:32.319
In this case

00:02:32.319 --> 00:02:36.456
It could be life-threatening.

00:02:36.456 --> 00:02:38.025
Summer is so hot

00:02:38.025 --> 00:02:39.926
Many people carry large kettles

00:02:39.926 --> 00:02:41.361
Drink a lot of water

00:02:41.361 --> 00:02:44.031
But if the kidneys

00:02:44.031 --> 00:02:46.099
can't keep up with the metabolism

00:02:46.099 --> 00:02:48.368
The water will be retained in the body

00:02:48.368 --> 00:02:49.469
You might say

00:02:49.469 --> 00:02:51.505
Isn't the purpose of drinking water to replenish water

00:02:51.505 --> 00:02:54.207
in the body and preserve it?

00:02:54.207 --> 00:02:55.375
Everyone

00:02:55.375 --> 00:02:56.910
Things are not as simple

00:02:56.910 --> 00:02:58.278
as fools think.

00:02:58.278 --> 00:02:59.079
attention

00:02:59.079 --> 00:03:02.516
Drinking too much water may lead to

00:03:02.516 --> 00:03:06.453
Swollen hands and feet, frequent urination, insomnia at night

00:03:06.453 --> 00:03:08.588
Make the body more tired

00:03:08.588 --> 00:03:10.490
Feeling tired the next day

00:03:10.490 --> 00:03:12.426
Affects work efficiency

00:03:12.426 --> 00:03:15.295
Swollen face, cold hands and feet

00:03:15.295 --> 00:03:16.863
It's not about&nbsp;

00:03:16.863 --> 00:03:19.132
drinking too little water

00:03:19.132 --> 00:03:21.134
The point is not to drink more water

00:03:21.134 --> 00:03:23.870
but rather whether it will be metabolized

00:03:23.870 --> 00:03:26.006
How Chinese medicine views drinking water

00:03:26.006 --> 00:03:27.407
It's not about how much drink

00:03:27.407 --> 00:03:28.842
But the water drink

00:03:28.842 --> 00:03:30.143
If too much

00:03:30.143 --> 00:03:31.812
Can it be metabolized?

00:03:31.812 --> 00:03:33.246
Cannot be metabolized

00:03:33.246 --> 00:03:34.247
There is a problem

00:03:34.247 --> 00:03:36.383
People with weak constitution

00:03:36.383 --> 00:03:38.618
Poor spleen and stomach function

00:03:38.618 --> 00:03:39.986
Drinking too much water

00:03:39.986 --> 00:03:42.055
Cannot be absorbed or metabolized

00:03:42.055 --> 00:03:43.356
Stuck in the body

00:03:43.356 --> 00:03:44.858
Do you know what it will become?

00:03:44.858 --> 00:03:46.159
Shī qì (Transliteration)

00:03:46.159 --> 00:03:48.662
This type of person often has a characteristic

00:03:48.662 --> 00:03:49.663
Drink water throughout the day

00:03:49.663 --> 00:03:50.630
Mouth is still dry

00:03:50.630 --> 00:03:51.531
Swollen face

00:03:51.531 --> 00:03:52.799
Cold hands and feet

00:03:52.799 --> 00:03:54.868
The water circulates in the body

00:03:54.868 --> 00:03:56.336
but can't be excreted

00:03:56.336 --> 00:03:58.605
In fact,

00:03:58.605 --> 00:03:59.706
the human body has a built-in drinking alarm

00:03:59.706 --> 00:04:01.942
called baroreceptors

00:04:01.942 --> 00:04:03.210
Automatically detects

00:04:03.210 --> 00:04:04.878
blood concentration

00:04:04.878 --> 00:04:06.146
The blood thickens

00:04:06.146 --> 00:04:07.948
When the osmotic pressure increases

00:04:07.948 --> 00:04:08.849
The brain naturally

00:04:08.849 --> 00:04:10.117
sends signals

00:04:10.117 --> 00:04:12.986
I'm thirsty, I need water

00:04:12.986 --> 00:04:14.020
Drink water at this time

00:04:14.020 --> 00:04:16.056
It's what the body needs

00:04:16.056 --> 00:04:17.691
When to rehydrate

00:04:17.691 --> 00:04:20.494
How much water should we drink a day

00:04:20.494 --> 00:04:22.429
How much water should you drink in a day?

00:04:22.429 --> 00:04:24.097
There is actually no standard answer

00:04:24.097 --> 00:04:27.300
It depends on your physical condition.

00:04:27.300 --> 00:04:29.369
There is also a lifestyle to adjust

00:04:29.369 --> 00:04:31.571
Listen to your body

00:04:31.571 --> 00:04:33.540
More important than listening to numbers

00:04:33.540 --> 00:04:35.408
If you sweat easily

00:04:35.408 --> 00:04:36.676
Dry mouth

00:04:36.676 --> 00:04:38.378
People with hot body constitution

00:04:38.378 --> 00:04:40.547
The water demand is naturally high

00:04:40.547 --> 00:04:41.882
xū hán (Transliteration) constitution

00:04:41.882 --> 00:04:42.816
Cold hands and feet

00:04:42.816 --> 00:04:43.917
Prone to diarrhea

00:04:43.917 --> 00:04:46.186
Not suitable for drinking a lot of water

00:04:46.186 --> 00:04:48.221
You should drink warm water slowly

00:04:48.221 --> 00:04:51.091
Avoid damage to the spleen and kidneys

00:04:51.091 --> 00:04:52.993
From the daily perspective

00:04:52.993 --> 00:04:55.562
Do you stay in an air-conditioned room all day?

00:04:55.562 --> 00:04:57.497
How much exercise do you do?

00:04:57.497 --> 00:04:59.132
Is there a lot of sweating?

00:04:59.132 --> 00:05:00.934
These can affect your needs

00:05:00.934 --> 00:05:02.169
How much water to drink

00:05:02.169 --> 00:05:04.004
Drink life-saving water like this

00:05:04.004 --> 00:05:07.107
Prevent cardiovascular and cerebrovascular diseases

00:05:07.107 --> 00:05:09.576
Drink a glass of life-saving water when you wake up in the morning

00:05:09.576 --> 00:05:10.110
Why

00:05:10.110 --> 00:05:12.012
You didn't drink water all night.

00:05:12.012 --> 00:05:14.347
After a full night's sleep

00:05:14.347 --> 00:05:18.251
The body is in a state of slight dehydration

00:05:18.251 --> 00:05:19.686
After getting up in the morning

00:05:19.686 --> 00:05:21.288
This is when the blood is thickest

00:05:21.288 --> 00:05:22.656
and blood pressure is highest.

00:05:22.656 --> 00:05:24.324
easily gets clogged

00:05:24.324 --> 00:05:25.258
I know

00:05:25.258 --> 00:05:26.726
Drink warm

00:05:26.726 --> 00:05:28.595
Warm your stomach and heart

00:05:28.595 --> 00:05:29.829
Good. Well said.

00:05:29.829 --> 00:05:30.297
Come

00:05:30.297 --> 00:05:31.464
Just drink this cup

00:05:31.464 --> 00:05:34.100
200cc warm water

00:05:34.100 --> 00:05:36.903
Please drink slowly.

00:05:36.903 --> 00:05:38.805
Allow water to be absorbed

00:05:38.805 --> 00:05:40.040
by the body gradually

00:05:40.040 --> 00:05:42.542
Don't drink it all in one go.

00:05:42.542 --> 00:05:45.178
Otherwise the blood will be diluted by you

00:05:45.178 --> 00:05:46.546
It puts more burden

00:05:46.546 --> 00:05:49.149
on the heart and kidneys.

00:05:49.149 --> 00:05:51.184
Why is this glass of water

00:05:51.184 --> 00:05:52.586
so important?

00:05:52.586 --> 00:05:55.322
Because it has three key functions

00:05:55.322 --> 00:05:55.922
No. 1

00:05:55.922 --> 00:05:59.125
Replenish the water you lose overnight

00:05:59.125 --> 00:06:00.927
Restoring balance in the body

00:06:00.927 --> 00:06:01.728
Second

00:06:01.728 --> 00:06:04.998
Awakening dormant internal organs

00:06:04.998 --> 00:06:07.400
Warm up your body slowly

00:06:07.400 --> 00:06:08.201
Third

00:06:08.201 --> 00:06:10.837
Helps the intestines clear waste

00:06:10.837 --> 00:06:12.072
Promote bowel movements

00:06:12.072 --> 00:06:14.074
Before you go out to work

00:06:14.074 --> 00:06:16.576
The body should work first

00:06:16.576 --> 00:06:18.378
Get rid of toxins

00:06:18.378 --> 00:06:20.847
People will become lighter

00:06:20.847 --> 00:06:22.315
More spirited

00:06:22.315 --> 00:06:23.783
In the morning,&nbsp;

00:06:23.783 --> 00:06:26.219
you can drink lemon water and honey water

00:06:26.219 --> 00:06:27.621
Change your taste occasionally

00:06:27.621 --> 00:06:29.089
Of course, no problem.

00:06:29.089 --> 00:06:31.224
But sugary drinks

00:06:31.224 --> 00:06:32.893
or oily drinks

00:06:32.892 --> 00:06:34.261
Can't drink every day

00:06:34.261 --> 00:06:35.528
Because these ingredients

00:06:35.528 --> 00:06:37.964
May make the blood thicker

00:06:37.964 --> 00:06:39.666
Increase the burden on the body

00:06:39.666 --> 00:06:42.202
It can't replace boiled water.

00:06:42.202 --> 00:06:44.204
Are you quietly lacking water?

00:06:44.204 --> 00:06:46.072
Seeing clues from 1 place

00:06:46.072 --> 00:06:48.208
Want to know if you are drinking enough water?

00:06:48.208 --> 00:06:49.743
The simplest way to judge

00:06:49.743 --> 00:06:52.979
Just check the color of your urine

00:06:52.979 --> 00:06:56.182
What if the color is darker?

00:06:56.182 --> 00:06:58.184
The darker the urine

00:06:58.184 --> 00:07:00.620
The greater the possibility of water shortage

00:07:00.620 --> 00:07:04.057
There are four levels

00:07:04.057 --> 00:07:05.592
You can tell the difference this way

00:07:05.592 --> 00:07:08.161
1.Urine is clear and colorless

00:07:08.161 --> 00:07:10.430
It means you drank too much water.

00:07:10.430 --> 00:07:12.065
Urine is diluted

00:07:12.065 --> 00:07:13.767
Stay hydrated

00:07:13.767 --> 00:07:16.903
You can drink less water at this time.

00:07:16.903 --> 00:07:19.306
2. Urine is light yellow

00:07:19.306 --> 00:07:20.874
If you are like this

00:07:20.874 --> 00:07:21.808
Then congratulations to you.

00:07:21.808 --> 00:07:23.910
It means you are in great condition.

00:07:23.910 --> 00:07:26.146
Adequate water intake and normal metabolism

00:07:26.146 --> 00:07:28.014
Keep it up

00:07:28.014 --> 00:07:31.751
3. Urine is dark yellow to orange

00:07:31.751 --> 00:07:33.520
Represents body water

00:07:33.520 --> 00:07:34.788
A little bit not enough

00:07:34.788 --> 00:07:36.456
You need water.

00:07:36.456 --> 00:07:38.358
Avoid further dehydration

00:07:38.358 --> 00:07:42.095
4.Urine is dark orange

00:07:42.095 --> 00:07:43.963
Or even brown.

00:07:43.963 --> 00:07:45.832
Severe water shortage

00:07:45.832 --> 00:07:47.967
Possible effects on the kidneys or liver

00:07:47.968 --> 00:07:48.868
At this time

00:07:48.868 --> 00:07:50.203
Drinking water is not enough

00:07:50.203 --> 00:07:51.705
If it is dark brown

00:07:51.705 --> 00:07:54.507
It may be that the liver metabolism is abnormal.

00:07:54.507 --> 00:07:57.944
See a doctor as soon as possible

00:07:57.944 --> 00:07:59.946
If your urine is unusual in color

00:07:59.946 --> 00:08:01.781
No improvement after drinking water

00:08:01.781 --> 00:08:03.917
Or have other discomfort

00:08:03.917 --> 00:08:05.785
Please see a doctor immediately

00:08:05.785 --> 00:08:07.620
Ensure your health

00:08:07.620 --> 00:08:08.822
Then you will ask me

00:08:08.822 --> 00:08:09.556
Doctor Hu

00:08:09.556 --> 00:08:10.857
When I get up in the morning

00:08:10.857 --> 00:08:12.659
First urine color

00:08:12.659 --> 00:08:14.127
It's also very yellow

00:08:14.127 --> 00:08:15.895
Why is my urine yellow in the morning?

00:08:15.895 --> 00:08:17.397
That's normal.

00:08:17.397 --> 00:08:19.499
You didn't drink water all night.

00:08:19.499 --> 00:08:21.568
Urine becomes more concentrated

00:08:21.568 --> 00:08:23.970
So the first urine after waking up is yellowish

00:08:23.970 --> 00:08:24.771
Don't worry

00:08:24.771 --> 00:08:27.474
As long as you drink water next time

00:08:27.474 --> 00:08:28.608
Urine color

00:08:28.608 --> 00:08:29.809
It will gradually fade

00:08:29.809 --> 00:08:32.645
If your urine is yellow all day long

00:08:32.645 --> 00:08:35.281
You should pay attention to whether there is water shortage.

00:08:35.281 --> 00:08:36.449
Sometimes eat

00:08:36.449 --> 00:08:37.450
Dragon fruit

00:08:37.450 --> 00:08:39.052
Will the color change?

00:08:39.052 --> 00:08:39.853
yes

00:08:39.853 --> 00:08:41.621
Dragon fruit color

00:08:41.621 --> 00:08:43.023
It is water soluble

00:08:43.023 --> 00:08:44.758
If there is too much, it will be excreted.

00:08:44.758 --> 00:08:45.425
Maybe it will turn red

00:08:45.425 --> 00:08:46.359
Maybe it will turn yellow

00:08:46.359 --> 00:08:47.293
Maybe it will turn something&nbsp;

00:08:47.293 --> 00:08:47.794
And what else

00:08:47.794 --> 00:08:49.029
You took B complex

00:08:49.029 --> 00:08:50.330
Or beetroot

00:08:50.330 --> 00:08:52.032
This type of food or nutritional supplement

00:08:52.032 --> 00:08:54.034
It may also let the color of urine

00:08:54.034 --> 00:08:55.235
Turn yellow or red

00:08:55.235 --> 00:08:55.969
so what

00:08:55.969 --> 00:08:57.070
Don't see urine

00:08:57.070 --> 00:08:58.738
get scared when it turns yellow or red

00:08:58.738 --> 00:09:01.341
First, we need to rule out the influence of diet

00:09:01.341 --> 00:09:04.244
Determine whether are really dehydrated.

00:09:04.244 --> 00:09:06.112
These three situations

00:09:06.112 --> 00:09:07.280
These three situations

00:09:07.280 --> 00:09:10.417
2-3 p.m.

00:09:10.417 --> 00:09:12.819
Office workers sitting

00:09:12.819 --> 00:09:13.987
From 2 to 3 p.m.

00:09:13.987 --> 00:09:15.955
Are you starting to yawn?

00:09:15.955 --> 00:09:17.290
just want to sleep.

00:09:17.290 --> 00:09:18.425
At this time

00:09:18.425 --> 00:09:21.161
Go to the tea room and get a glass of water

00:09:21.161 --> 00:09:23.363
Help you refresh your mind

00:09:23.363 --> 00:09:24.397
Focus

00:09:24.397 --> 00:09:27.100
Make your afternoon work more efficient

00:09:27.100 --> 00:09:29.602
2 When the body sweats

00:09:29.602 --> 00:09:31.371
When you go to the sauna

00:09:31.371 --> 00:09:34.808
Bathing and exercise will make you sweat

00:09:34.808 --> 00:09:36.876
At this time, a lot of water is lost.

00:09:36.876 --> 00:09:39.479
Remember to drink water to cool down

00:09:39.479 --> 00:09:41.648
Regulating body temperature

00:09:41.648 --> 00:09:43.516
3 When taking a plane

00:09:43.516 --> 00:09:45.919
The air humidity on the plane is very low

00:09:45.919 --> 00:09:48.021
Only about 20%

00:09:48.021 --> 00:09:49.956
This will make your skin

00:09:49.956 --> 00:09:51.591
Easily becomes dry and dehydrated.

00:09:51.591 --> 00:09:54.694
Remember to drink water frequently during this time.

